- Roof colours are derived from GUGiK orthophotos, licensed under CC BY 4.0.
- Building heights are derived from GUGiK LoD1 2024 3D building models, licensed under CC BY 4.0.
- Construction dates are derived from the NID immovable heritage register (dane.gov.pl).
- Tram timetable data is derived from the MPK Wrocław GTFS feed (Otwarte Dane Wrocław).
